                    ),
                  ),
                  SizedBox(height: 6),
                  Text(
                    AppLocalizations.of(context)!.combienDeCartesPensezVous,
                    textAlign: TextAlign.center,
                    style: TextStyle(
                      color: Colors.white.withOpacity(0.7),
                      fontSize: 13,
                    ),
                  ),
                  SizedBox(height: 24),
                  Row(
                    mainAxisAlignment: MainAxisAlignment.center,
                    children: [
                      IconButton(
                        onPressed:
