                          AppLocalizations.of(context)!.enAttenteDeLaDecision,
                          style: TextStyle(
                            color: Colors.white54,
                            fontStyle: FontStyle.italic,
                          ),
                        ),
                      ),
                    ],
                  ],
                ],
              ),
            ),
          ),
        ],
      ),
    );
  }

  // --- WIDGET HELPER : DISQUE SKULL TACTILE & MODERNE ---
  Widget _buildSkullDiscCard({
    required String type,
    required String label,
    required IconData icon,
    required Color color,
    required int count,
    required bool isMyTurn,
    required VoidCallback onTap,
  }) {
    final bool hasCard = count > 0;
    final bool canInteract = isMyTurn && hasCard && !_isActionPending;

    return Expanded(
      child: GestureDetector(
        onTap: canInteract ? onTap : null,
        child: AnimatedContainer(
          duration: Duration(milliseconds: 200),
          padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(vertical: 14, horizontal: 12),
          decoration: BoxDecoration(
            gradient: LinearGradient(
              colors: [
                canInteract
                    ? color.withOpacity(0.25)
                    : Colors.white.withOpacity(0.04),
                canInteract
                    ? color.withOpacity(0.08)
                    : Colors.white.withOpacity(0.02),
              ],
              begin: Alignment.topLeft,
              end: Alignment.bottomRight,
            ),
            borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(20),
            border: Border.all(
              color: canInteract ? color.withOpacity(0.8) : Colors.white12,
              width: canInteract ? 1.5 : 1,
            ),
            boxShadow:
                canInteract
                    ? [
                      BoxShadow(
                        color: color.withOpacity(0.2),
                        blurRadius: 10,
                        offset: Offset(0, 4),
                      ),
                    ]
                    : [],
          ),
          child: Column(
            mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
            children: [
              Row(
                mainAxisAlignment: MainAxisAlignment.spaceBetween,
                children: [
                  Text(
                    label,
                    style: TextStyle(
                      fontSize: 11,
                      fontWeight: FontWeight.w900,
                      letterSpacing: 1,
                      color: hasCard ? color : Colors.white30,
                    ),
                  ),
                  Container(
                    padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(
                      horizontal: 7,
                      vertical: 2,
                    ),
                    decoration: BoxDecoration(
                      color: hasCard ? color.withOpacity(0.2) : Colors.white10,
                      borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(10),
                    ),
                    child: Text(
                      "x$count",
                      style: TextStyle(
                        fontSize: 11,
                        fontWeight: FontWeight.bold,
                        color: hasCard ? color : Colors.white30,
                      ),
                    ),
                  ),
                ],
              ),
              SizedBox(height: 8),
              Icon(icon, size: 38, color: hasCard ? color : Colors.white24),
            ],
          ),
        ),
      ),
    );
  }

  int _lastPictionaryRound = -1;

  Widget _buildPictionaryUI(
    BuildContext context,
    Map<String, dynamic> gameData,
    String playerId,
  ) {
    final int currentPictionaryRound =
        (gameData['currentRound'] as num?)?.toInt() ?? 0;
    if (_lastPictionaryRound != currentPictionaryRound) {
      _lastPictionaryRound = currentPictionaryRound;
      _pictionaryDrawingController.clear();
    }
    final String roundState = gameData['roundState'] ?? 'setup';
    final Map<String, dynamic> players = Map<String, dynamic>.from(
      gameData['players'] ?? {},
    );
    final String? currentDrawingPlayerId = gameData['currentDrawingPlayerId'];
    final String? currentPictionaryWord = gameData['currentPictionaryWord'];
    final String? pictionaryDrawingData = gameData['pictionaryDrawing'];

    final Timestamp? startTime = gameData['pictionaryStartTime'];
    final int roundDuration =
        (roundState == 'drawing')
            ? (gameData['turnTimerSeconds'] ?? 90)
            : (gameData['resultTimerSeconds'] ?? 30);

    int secondsRemaining = 0;
    if (startTime != null) {
      secondsRemaining = max(
        0,
        roundDuration - DateTime.now().difference(startTime.toDate()).inSeconds,
      );
    }

    final bool pictionaryOnly30Strokes =
        gameData['pictionaryOnly30Strokes'] == true;
    final bool isCollective = gameData['pictionaryTeams'] == true;
    final int collectiveCardIndex =
        (gameData['pictionaryCollectiveCardIndex'] ?? 0) as int;
    final int collectiveGuessed =
        (gameData['pictionaryCollectiveGuessed'] ?? 0) as int;
    final int collectiveTotal =
        (gameData['pictionaryCollectiveWords'] as List?)?.length ?? 13;
    final bool amIDrawingPlayer = playerId == currentDrawingPlayerId;
    final bool drawingBlocked =
        pictionaryOnly30Strokes && _pictionaryStrokeCount >= 30;
    final String drawerName =
        players[currentDrawingPlayerId]?['name'] ??
        AppLocalizations.of(context)!.timesUpSomeone;

    if (roundState == 'result') {
      return _buildResultUI(context, gameData, playerId);
    }

    return Column(
      children: [
        // EN-TÊTE AVEC INFO (Simplifié)
        if (amIDrawingPlayer)
          Container(
            padding: EdgeInsets.symmetric(vertical: 4),
            child: Text(
              AppLocalizations.of(context)!.str4c885c(
                AppLocalizations.of(context)!.motADessiner,
                currentPictionaryWord != null
                    ? GameUiLocalization.tr(context, currentPictionaryWord)
                    : "...",
              ),
              style: TextStyle(
                fontSize: 22,
                fontWeight: FontWeight.bold,
                color: Colors.amberAccent,
              ),
              textAlign: TextAlign.center,
            ),
          ),
        SizedBox(height: 6),

        // ZONE DE DESSIN (TABLEAU BLANC)
        Expanded(
          flex: 5,
          child: Container(
            margin: EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 8),
            decoration: BoxDecoration(
              color: Colors.white,
              borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(12),
              border: Border.all(
                color: Colors.grey[400]!,
                width: 8,
              ), // Cadre épais style tableau
              boxShadow: [
                BoxShadow(
                  color: Colors.black45,
                  blurRadius: 10,
                  offset: Offset(0, 5),
                ),
              ],
            ),
            child: Stack(
              children: [
                // Canvas ou Image
                ClipRRect(
                  borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(4),
                  child:
                      amIDrawingPlayer
                          ? (pictionaryOnly30Strokes
                              // Mode 30 traits : segments droits uniquement
                              ? RepaintBoundary(
                                key: _straightLineKey,
                                child: GestureDetector(
                                  onPanStart:
                                      drawingBlocked
                                          ? null
                                          : (d) {
                                            setState(
                                              () =>
                                                  _straightLineStart =
                                                      d.localPosition,
                                            );
                                          },
                                  onPanUpdate:
                                      drawingBlocked
                                          ? null
                                          : (d) {
                                            if (_straightLineStart != null) {
                                              setState(
                                                () =>
                                                    _straightLineCurrentEnd =
                                                        d.localPosition,
                                              );
                                            }
                                          },
                                  onPanEnd:
                                      drawingBlocked
                                          ? null
                                          : (d) async {
                                            if (_straightLineStart == null ||
                                                _straightLineCurrentEnd == null)
                                              return;
                                            setState(() {
                                              _straightLinePoints.add(
                                                _straightLineStart!,
                                              );
                                              _straightLinePoints.add(
                                                _straightLineCurrentEnd!,
                                              );
                                              _straightLineStart = null;
                                              _straightLineCurrentEnd = null;
                                              _pictionaryStrokeCount++;
                                            });
                                            // Capture and upload
                                            await Future.delayed(
                                              Duration(milliseconds: 50),
                                            );
                                            if (!mounted) return;
                                            try {
                                              final boundary =
                                                  _straightLineKey
                                                          .currentContext
                                                          ?.findRenderObject()
                                                      as RenderRepaintBoundary?;
                                              if (boundary != null) {
                                                final image = await boundary
                                                    .toImage(pixelRatio: 1.0);
                                                final bytes = await image
                                                    .toByteData(
                                                      format:
                                                          ui
                                                              .ImageByteFormat
                                                              .png,
                                                    );
                                                if (bytes != null && mounted) {
                                                  final base64Image =
                                                      base64Encode(
                                                        bytes.buffer
                                                            .asUint8List(),
                                                      );
                                                  await _firebaseService
                                                      .updatePictionaryDrawing(
                                                        widget.gameCode,
                                                        base64Image,
                                                        _pictionaryStrokeCount,
                                                      );
                                                }
                                              }
                                            } catch (_) {}
                                          },
                                  child: CustomPaint(
                                    foregroundPainter: _StraightLinePainter(
                                      points: _straightLinePoints,
                                      currentStart: _straightLineStart,
                                      currentEnd: _straightLineCurrentEnd,
                                    ),
                                    child: Container(color: Colors.white),
                                  ),
                                ),
                              )
                              // Mode libre : Signature widget
                              : AbsorbPointer(
                                absorbing: drawingBlocked,
                                child: Listener(
                                  onPointerUp: (_) async {
                                    setState(() => _pictionaryStrokeCount++);
                                    if (_pictionaryDrawingController
                                        .isNotEmpty) {
                                      final pngBytes =
                                          await _pictionaryDrawingController
                                              .toPngBytes();
                                      if (pngBytes != null) {
                                        final String base64Image = base64Encode(
                                          pngBytes,
                                        );
                                        await _firebaseService
                                            .updatePictionaryDrawing(
                                              widget.gameCode,
                                              base64Image,
                                              _pictionaryStrokeCount,
                                            );
                                      }
                                    }
                                  },
                                  child: Signature(
                                    controller: _pictionaryDrawingController,
                                    backgroundColor: Colors.white,
                                  ),
                                ),
                              ))
                          // Utilisation de Realtime Database pour éviter le spam de StreamBuilder Firestore
                          : StreamBuilder<DatabaseEvent>(
                            stream:
                                FirebaseDatabase.instance
                                    .ref(
                                      'games/${widget.gameCode}/pictionary/drawing',
                                    )
                                    .onValue,
                            builder: (context, snapshot) {
                              final data =
                                  snapshot.data?.snapshot.value as String?;
                              if (data != null &&
                                  data.isNotEmpty &&
                                  data != 'rtdb_used') {
                                return Image.memory(
                                  base64Decode(data),
                                  gaplessPlayback: true,
                                  fit: BoxFit.contain,
                                  width: double.infinity,
                                  height: double.infinity,
                                  filterQuality: FilterQuality.low,
                                );
                              }
                              return Center(
                                child: Column(
                                  mainAxisAlignment: MainAxisAlignment.center,
                                  children: [
                                    Icon(
                                      Icons.brush,
                                      size: 40,
                                      color: Colors.grey[300],
                                    ),
                                    Text(
                                      AppLocalizations.of(
                                        context,
                                      )!.enAttenteDuDessin,
                                      style: TextStyle(color: Colors.grey[400]),
                                    ),
                                  ],
                                ),
                              );
                            },
                          ),
                ),

                // Petit badge avec le nom de l'artiste et compteur de traits
                Positioned(
                  top: 10,
                  left: 10,
                  child: Container(
                    padding: EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 8, vertical: 4),
                    decoration: BoxDecoration(
                      color: Colors.black12,
                      borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(10),
                    ),
                    child: Row(
                      children: [
                        Icon(Icons.edit, size: 12, color: Colors.black54),
                        SizedBox(width: 4),
                        Text(
                          drawerName,
                          style: TextStyle(color: Colors.black54, fontSize: 12),
                        ),
                        if (pictionaryOnly30Strokes && amIDrawingPlayer) ...[
                          SizedBox(width: 8),
                          Text(
                            AppLocalizations.of(
                              context,
                            )!.pictionaryStrokesCount(_pictionaryStrokeCount),
                            style: TextStyle(
                              color:
                                  drawingBlocked ? Colors.red : Colors.black54,
                              fontSize: 12,
                              fontWeight: FontWeight.bold,
                            ),
                          ),
                        ],
                      ],
                    ),
                  ),
                ),

                // Bouton Clear pour le dessinateur
                if (amIDrawingPlayer)
                  Positioned(
                    top: 10,
                    right: 10,
                    child: IconButton(
                      icon: Icon(Icons.delete, color: Colors.red),
                      onPressed: () {
                        setState(() {
                          _pictionaryStrokeCount = 0;
                          _straightLinePoints = [];
                          _straightLineStart = null;
                          _straightLineCurrentEnd = null;
                        });
                        _pictionaryDrawingController.clear();
                        _firebaseService.updatePictionaryDrawing(
                          widget.gameCode,
                          "",
                          0,
                        );
                      },
                    ),
                  ),
              ],
            ),
          ),
        ),

        // ZONE DE CHAT / DEVINETTES
        Expanded(
          flex: 4,
          child: Column(
            children: [
              Expanded(
                child: Builder(
                  builder: (context) {
                    // Utilisation du Provider pour avoir les mises à jour en temps réel
                    final gameDataFromProvider =
                        Provider.of<DocumentSnapshot>(
                              context,
                              listen: true,
                            ).data()
                            as Map<String, dynamic>;
                    final List<dynamic> pictionaryGuesses = List.from(
                      gameDataFromProvider['pictionaryGuesses'] ?? [],
                    );

                    pictionaryGuesses.sort(
                      (a, b) => (a['timestamp'] as int).compareTo(
                        b['timestamp'] as int,
                      ),
                    );

                    return ListView.builder(
                      reverse:
                          true, // Pour afficher les nouveaux messages en bas
                      itemCount: pictionaryGuesses.length,
                      itemBuilder: (context, index) {
                        final guessData =
                            pictionaryGuesses.reversed.toList()[index]
                                as Map<String, dynamic>;

                        return Card(
                          color: Colors.grey[900],
                          margin: EdgeInsets.symmetric(
                            vertical: 2,
                            horizontal: 8,
                          ),
                          child: ListTile(
                            dense: true,
                            title: Text(
                              guessData['guess'] ?? '',
                              style: TextStyle(fontWeight: FontWeight.bold),
                            ),
                            subtitle: Text(
                              guessData['guesserName'] ?? '...',
                              style: TextStyle(fontSize: 10),
                            ),
                            // Bouton pour valider la bonne réponse (seulement pour le dessinateur)
                            trailing:
                                amIDrawingPlayer
                                    ? ElevatedButton(
                                      onPressed:
                                          () => _firebaseService
                                              .validatePictionaryGuess(
                                                widget.gameCode,
                                                guessData['guesserId'],
                                              ),
                                      child: Icon(Icons.check, size: 16),
                                      style: ElevatedButton.styleFrom(
                                        backgroundColor: Colors.green,
                                        padding: EdgeInsets.all(8),
                                        shape: CircleBorder(),
                                        minimumSize: Size(30, 30),
                                      ),
                                    )
                                    : null,
                          ),
                        );
                      },
                    );
                  },
                ),
              ),
            ],
          ),
        ),
      ],
    );
  }

  Widget _buildJustOneUI(
    BuildContext context,
    Map<String, dynamic> gameData,
    String playerId,
  ) {
    final String roundState = gameData['roundState'] ?? 'clue_giving';
    final Map<String, dynamic> players = Map<String, dynamic>.from(
      gameData['players'] ?? {},
    );
    final String? justOneGuesserId = gameData['justOneGuesserId'];
    final String? justOneCurrentWord = gameData['justOneCurrentWord'];
    final Map<String, dynamic> justOneClues = Map<String, dynamic>.from(
      gameData['justOneClues'] ?? {},
    );
    final List<dynamic> justOneFilteredClues = List<dynamic>.from(
      gameData['justOneFilteredClues'] ?? [],
    );
    final int deckIndex = (gameData['justOneDeckIndex'] ?? 0) + 1;
    final int deckTotal = (gameData['justOneDeck'] as List?)?.length ?? 13;
    final int totalScore = gameData['justOneTotalScore'] ?? 0;

    bool amIGuesser = playerId == justOneGuesserId;
    String guesserName =
        players[justOneGuesserId]?['name'] ??
        AppLocalizations.of(context)!.timesUpSomeone;

    // Reset flag si nouveau tour (indice pas encore soumis)
    if (roundState == 'clue_giving' && !justOneClues.containsKey(playerId)) {
      _justOneHasSubmittedClue = false;
    }

    // Fin de partie collective
    if (gameData['gameState'] == 'gameOver') {
      String rating =
          totalScore >= 12
              ? AppLocalizations.of(context)!.stre9f4a5
              : totalScore >= 10
              ? AppLocalizations.of(context)!.str21f597
              : totalScore >= 7
              ? AppLocalizations.of(context)!.str59ee4e
              : totalScore >= 4
              ? AppLocalizations.of(context)!.strb6f91d
              : AppLocalizations.of(context)!.strc0046c;
      bool isHost = gameData['hostId'] == playerId;
      return Center(
        child: Card(
          child: Padding(
            padding: const EdgeInsets.all(24.0),
            child: Column(
              mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
              children: [
                Text(
                  AppLocalizations.of(context)!.partieTerminee1,
                  style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.headlineMedium,
                  textAlign: TextAlign.center,
                ),
                SizedBox(height: 16),
                Text(
                  AppLocalizations.of(context)!.scoreCollectif,
                  style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.titleLarge,
                  textAlign: TextAlign.center,
                ),
                SizedBox(height: 8),
                Text(
                  '$totalScore / $deckTotal',
                  style: TextStyle(
                    fontSize: 64,
                    fontWeight: FontWeight.bold,
                    color: Colors.amberAccent,
                  ),
                  textAlign: TextAlign.center,
                ),
                SizedBox(height: 8),
                Text(
                  rating,
                  style: TextStyle(fontSize: 22),
                  textAlign: TextAlign.center,
                ),
                SizedBox(height: 24),
                if (isHost)
                  ElevatedButton(
                    onPressed:
                        _isActionPending
                            ? null
                            : () {
                              setState(() => _isActionPending = true);
                              _firebaseService
                                  .returnToLobby(widget.gameCode)
                                  .whenComplete(() {
                                    if (mounted)
                                      setState(() => _isActionPending = false);
                                  });
                            },
                    child: Text(AppLocalizations.of(context)!.retourAuSalon1),
                  ),
              ],
            ),
          ),
        ),
      );
    }

    // Résultat du tour
    if (roundState == 'result') {
      final String answer = gameData['justOneGuesserAnswer'] ?? '';
      final bool wasCorrect =
          answer.trim().toLowerCase() ==
          (justOneCurrentWord ?? '').toLowerCase();
      bool isHost = gameData['hostId'] == playerId;
      return Center(
        child: Card(
          child: Padding(
            padding: const EdgeInsets.all(24.0),
            child: Column(
              mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
              children: [
                Text(
                  AppLocalizations.of(context)!.carte4(deckIndex, deckTotal),
                  style: TextStyle(color: Colors.white54, fontSize: 14),
                ),
                SizedBox(height: 12),
                Text(
                  wasCorrect
                      ? AppLocalizations.of(context)!.str85bff7
                      : AppLocalizations.of(context)!.strfa1b8c,
                  style: TextStyle(
                    fontSize: 28,
                    fontWeight: FontWeight.bold,
                    color: wasCorrect ? Colors.greenAccent : Colors.redAccent,
                  ),
                  textAlign: TextAlign.center,
                ),
                SizedBox(height: 8),
                Text(
                  "${AppLocalizations.of(context)!.leMotEtaitLabel} ${justOneCurrentWord ?? ''}",
                  style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.titleLarge,
                  textAlign: TextAlign.center,
                ),
                if (answer.isNotEmpty)
                  Text(
                    AppLocalizations.of(
                      context,
                    )!.reponseDeJoueur(guesserName, answer),
                    style: TextStyle(color: Colors.white70),
                    textAlign: TextAlign.center,
                  ),
                SizedBox(height: 16),
                Container(
                  padding: EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 24, vertical: 12),
                  decoration: BoxDecoration(
                    color: Colors.amberAccent.withOpacity(0.15),
                    borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(12),
                  ),
                  child: Text(
                    "${AppLocalizations.of(context)!.score} : $totalScore / $deckIndex",
                    style: TextStyle(
                      fontSize: 20,
                      fontWeight: FontWeight.bold,
                      color: Colors.amberAccent,
                    ),
                  ),
                ),
                SizedBox(height: 20),
                if (isHost)
                  ElevatedButton(
                    onPressed:
                        _isActionPending
                            ? null
                            : () {
                              setState(() => _isActionPending = true);
                              _firebaseService
                                  .nextJustOneRound(widget.gameCode)
                                  .whenComplete(() {
                                    if (mounted)
                                      setState(() => _isActionPending = false);
                                  });
                            },
                    child:
                        _isActionPending
                            ? CircularProgressIndicator(color: Colors.white)
                            : Text(
                              deckIndex >= deckTotal
                                  ? AppLocalizations.of(
                                    context,
                                  )!.voirLeScoreFinal
                                  : "${AppLocalizations.of(context)!.carteSuivante} →",
                            ),
                  ),
                if (!isHost)
                  Text(
                    AppLocalizations.of(context)!.enAttenteDeLHote5,
                    style: TextStyle(color: Colors.white54),
                  ),
              ],
            ),
          ),
        ),
      );
    }

    switch (roundState) {
      // --- PHASE 2 : LES AUTRES ÉCRIVENT LES INDICES ---
      case 'clue_giving':
        if (amIGuesser) {
          return Column(
            mainAxisAlignment: MainAxisAlignment.center,
            children: [
              Text(
                AppLocalizations.of(context)!.str487ca1,
                style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.headlineSmall,
              ),
              SizedBox(height: 8),
              Text(
                GameContentLocalization.format(
                  context,
                  AppLocalizations.of(context)!.carte,
                  [deckIndex, deckTotal],
                ),
                style: TextStyle(color: Colors.white54, fontSize: 14),
              ),
              SizedBox(height: 20),
              Text(
                AppLocalizations.of(context)!.lesAutresEcriventDesIndices,
                style: TextStyle(fontSize: 16, color: Colors.white70),
              ),
              SizedBox(height: 30),
              _buildWaitingWidget(
                AppLocalizations.of(
                  context,
                )!.indicesSoumisCount(justOneClues.length, players.length - 1),
                players,
                justOneClues.length,
                players.length - 1,
              ),
            ],
          );
        } else {
          // Si j'ai déjà soumis
          if (justOneClues.containsKey(playerId) || _justOneHasSubmittedClue) {
            return _buildWaitingWidget(
              AppLocalizations.of(context)!.indiceEnvoyeEnAttenteDes1,
              players,
              justOneClues.length,
              players.length - 1,
            );
          }
          return Column(
            mainAxisAlignment: MainAxisAlignment.center,
            children: [
              Text(
                AppLocalizations.of(context)!.str6bd6b6(
                  AppLocalizations.of(context)!.carte3,
                  deckIndex,
                  deckTotal,
                  AppLocalizations.of(context)!.score,
                  totalScore,
                ),
                style: TextStyle(color: Colors.white54, fontSize: 14),
              ),
              SizedBox(height: 8),
              Text(
                AppLocalizations.of(context)!.faitesDevinerLeMot,
                style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.bodyMedium,
              ),
              Container(
                padding: EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 20, vertical: 10),
                margin: EdgeInsets.symmetric(vertical: 10),
                decoration: BoxDecoration(
                  color: Colors.white,
                  borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(10),
                ),
                child: Text(
                  justOneCurrentWord ?? "...",
                  style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.headlineMedium?.copyWith(
                    color: Colors.deepPurple,
                    fontWeight: FontWeight.bold,
                  ),
                ),
              ),
              SizedBox(height: 20),
              TextField(
                controller: _justOneClueController,
                decoration: InputDecoration(
                  labelText: AppLocalizations.of(context)!.tonIndiceUnSeulMot,
                ),
                onChanged:
                    (val) =>
                        setState(() {}), // Rafraichit pour activer le bouton
              ),
              SizedBox(height: 10),
              ElevatedButton(
                onPressed:
                    _justOneClueController.text.trim().isEmpty ||
                            _isActionPending
                        ? null
                        : () {
                          if (_justOneClueController.text
                                  .trim()
                                  .split(' ')
                                  .length >
                              1) {
                            ScaffoldMessenger.of(context).showSnackBar(
                              SnackBar(
                                content: Text(
                                  AppLocalizations.of(
                                    context,
                                  )!.unSeulMotAutorise,
                                ),
                              ),
                            );
                            return;
                          }
                          setState(() => _isActionPending = true);
                          _firebaseService
                              .submitJustOneClue(
                                widget.gameCode,
                                playerId,
                                _justOneClueController.text.trim(),
                              )
                              .then((_) {
                                if (mounted)
                                  setState(() {
                                    _justOneHasSubmittedClue = true;
                                  });
                              })
                              .whenComplete(() {
                                if (mounted)
                                  setState(() => _isActionPending = false);
                              });
                          _justOneClueController.clear();
                        },
                child:
                    _isActionPending
                        ? CircularProgressIndicator(color: Colors.white)
                        : Text(AppLocalizations.of(context)!.envoyerLIndice),
              ),
            ],
          );
        }

      // --- PHASE 3 : LE DEVIN LIT LES INDICES ---
      case 'reveal_clues':
        if (!amIGuesser) {
          return Center(
            child: Column(
              mainAxisAlignment: MainAxisAlignment.center,
              children: [
                Text(
                  GameContentLocalization.format(
                    context,
                    AppLocalizations.of(context)!.carte,
                    [deckIndex, deckTotal],
                  ),
                  style: TextStyle(color: Colors.white54, fontSize: 14),
                ),
                SizedBox(height: 8),
                Text(
                  "${AppLocalizations.of(context)!.leMotEst} ${justOneCurrentWord}",
                  style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.titleLarge,
                ),
                SizedBox(height: 20),
                Text(
                  "${AppLocalizations.of(context)!.indicesMontresA} $guesserName :",
                  style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white70),
                ),
                SizedBox(height: 20),
                Wrap(
                  alignment: WrapAlignment.center,
                  children:
                      justOneFilteredClues
                          .map((clue) => _buildEasel(clue.toString()))
                          .toList(),
                ),
                SizedBox(height: 20),
                if (justOneFilteredClues.isEmpty)
                  Text(
                    AppLocalizations.of(context)!.tousLesIndicesOntEte,
                    style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.red),
                  ),
              ],
            ),
          );
        } else {
          // C'est au devin de jouer
          return Column(
            children: [
              Text(
                "${AppLocalizations.of(context)!.carte3} $deckIndex / $deckTotal — ${AppLocalizations.of(context)!.score} : $totalScore",
                style: TextStyle(color: Colors.white54, fontSize: 14),
              ),
              SizedBox(height: 8),
              Text(
                AppLocalizations.of(context)!.voiciTesIndices,
                style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.headlineSmall,
              ),
              SizedBox(height: 20),

              if (justOneFilteredClues.isEmpty)
                Container(
                  padding: EdgeInsets.all(20),
                  decoration: BoxDecoration(
                    color: Colors.red.withOpacity(0.2),
                    borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(10),
                  ),
                  child: Text(
                    AppLocalizations.of(context)!.aieTousLesIndicesEtaient,
                    style: TextStyle(color: Colors.white),
                    textAlign: TextAlign.center,
                  ),
                )
              else
                Wrap(
                  alignment: WrapAlignment.center,
                  children:
                      justOneFilteredClues
                          .map((clue) => _buildEasel(clue.toString()))
                          .toList(),
                ),

              Spacer(),

              TextField(
                controller: _justOneGuessController,
                decoration: InputDecoration(
                  labelText: AppLocalizations.of(context)!.taProposition,
                ),
                onChanged: (val) => setState(() {}),
              ),
              SizedBox(height: 10),
              ElevatedButton(
                onPressed:
                    _justOneGuessController.text.trim().isEmpty ||
                            _isActionPending
                        ? null
                        : () {
                          setState(() => _isActionPending = true);
                          _firebaseService
                              .submitJustOneGuess(
                                widget.gameCode,
                                widget.playerId,
                                _justOneGuessController.text.trim(),
                              )
                              .whenComplete(() {
                                if (mounted)
                                  setState(() => _isActionPending = false);
                              });
                          _justOneGuessController.clear();
                        },
                child:
                    _isActionPending
                        ? CircularProgressIndicator(color: Colors.white)
                        : Text(AppLocalizations.of(context)!.jeValide),
              ),
              SizedBox(height: 20),
            ],
          );
        }

      default:
        return _buildWaitingWidget(
          AppLocalizations.of(context)!.chargement,
          players,
          0,
          0,
        );
    }
  }

  Widget _buildHotPotatoUI(
    BuildContext context,
    Map<String, dynamic> gameData,
    String playerId,
  ) {
    final String roundState = gameData['roundState'] ?? 'playing';
    final Map<String, dynamic> players = Map<String, dynamic>.from(
      gameData['players'] ?? {},
    );
    final String? currentPotatoPlayerId = gameData['hotPotatoCurrentPlayerId'];

    // Handle gameOver for Categories
    if (gameData['gameState'] == 'gameOver') {
      final String gameEndReason =
          gameData['gameEndReason'] ??
          AppLocalizations.of(context)!.partieTerminee1;
      List<MapEntry<String, int>> sortedScores = [];
      players.forEach((id, data) {
        sortedScores.add(
          MapEntry(
            data['name'] ?? AppLocalizations.of(context)!.inconnu,
            data['score'] ?? 0,
          ),
        );
      });
      sortedScores.sort((a, b) => a.value.compareTo(b.value));
      return Center(
        child: Card(
          child: Padding(
            padding: const EdgeInsets.all(24.0),
            child: Column(
              mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
              children: [
                Text(
                  AppLocalizations.of(context)!.partieTerminee,
                  style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.headlineMedium,
                ),
                SizedBox(height: 10),
                Text(
                  GameMessageLocalization.tr(context, gameEndReason),
                  style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.headlineSmall?.copyWith(
                    color: Colors.amberAccent,
                  ),
                ),
                SizedBox(height: 20),
                Text(
                  AppLocalizations.of(context)!.classementFinal1,
                  style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.titleLarge,
                ),
                SizedBox(height: 8),
                ...sortedScores.asMap().entries.map(
                  (e) => Padding(
                    padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(vertical: 2),
                    child: Text(
                      AppLocalizations.of(context)!.pt(
                        e.key + 1,
                        e.value.key,
                        e.value.value,
                        e.value.value > 1 ? 's' : '',
                      ),
                      style: TextStyle(
                        fontSize: 16,
                        fontWeight:
                            e.key == 0 ? FontWeight.bold : FontWeight.normal,
                      ),
                    ),
                  ),
                ),
                SizedBox(height: 20),
                ElevatedButton(
                  onPressed:
                      () => Navigator.of(
                        context,
                      ).popUntil((route) => route.isFirst),
                  child: Text(AppLocalizations.of(context)!.retourALAccueil),
                ),
              ],
            ),
          ),
        ),
      );
    }

    int secondsLeft = gameData['hotPotatoSecondsLeft'] ?? 0;
    if (gameData['hotPotatoRoundStartedAt'] != null) {
      final Timestamp startTimeStamp = gameData['hotPotatoRoundStartedAt'];
      final DateTime startTime = startTimeStamp.toDate();
      final int duration = secondsLeft;
      final int elapsed = DateTime.now().difference(startTime).inSeconds;
      secondsLeft = max(0, duration - elapsed);
    }

    final String category =
        gameData['hotPotatoCategory'] ??
        AppLocalizations.of(context)!.categorie;
    final List<String> usedAnswers = List<String>.from(
      gameData['hotPotatoUsedAnswers'] ?? [],
    );

    final bool isMyTurn = playerId == currentPotatoPlayerId;
    final String currentPotatoPlayerName =
        players[currentPotatoPlayerId]?['name'] ??
        AppLocalizations.of(context)!.quelquUn;

    if (roundState == 'exploded') {
      return _buildHotPotatoExplodedUI(context, gameData, playerId);
    }

    // Couleur de fond dynamique (Vert -> Rouge)
    Color timerColor =
        secondsLeft > 10
            ? Colors.green
            : (secondsLeft > 5 ? Colors.orange : Colors.red);
    // Animation simple de pulsation quand il reste peu de temps
    double pulseScale =
        isMyTurn
            ? (1.0 +
                (secondsLeft <= 5
                    ? (DateTime.now().millisecond % 500) / 1000.0
                    : 0.0))
            : 1.0;

    final String gameType = gameData['gameType'] ?? '';
    final bool isCategories = gameType == 'Le Jeu des Catégories';
    final int currentRound = gameData['currentRound'] ?? 1;

    return Column(
      mainAxisAlignment: MainAxisAlignment.center,
      children: [
        // Round & score info for Categories
        if (isCategories) ...[
          Row(
            mainAxisAlignment: MainAxisAlignment.spaceBetween,
            children: [
              Text(
                "${AppLocalizations.of(context)!.mancheLabel} $currentRound",
                style: TextStyle(fontWeight: FontWeight.bold, fontSize: 14),
              ),
              Row(
                mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
                children:
                    players.entries
                        .map(
                          (e) => Padding(
                            padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 4),
                            child: Chip(
                              label: Text(
                                AppLocalizations.of(context)!.strf0868c(
                                  e.value['name']?.toString().substring(
                                        0,
                                        min(
                                          4,
                                          (e.value['name']?.toString().length ??
                                              0),
                                        ),
                                      ) ??
                                      '',
                                  e.value['score'] ?? 0,
                                ),
                                style: TextStyle(fontSize: 11),
                              ),
                              padding: EdgeInsets.zero,
                              visualDensity: VisualDensity.compact,
                            ),
                          ),
                        )
                        .toList(),
              ),
            ],
          ),
          SizedBox(height: 8),
        ],
        // Indicateur de tour
        Container(
          padding: EdgeInsets.all(16),
          decoration: BoxDecoration(
            color:
                isMyTurn
                    ? Colors.redAccent.withOpacity(0.2)
                    : Colors.transparent,
            borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(20),
            border:
                isMyTurn ? Border.all(color: Colors.redAccent, width: 2) : null,
          ),
          child: Column(
            children: [
              Text(
                isMyTurn
                    ? AppLocalizations.of(context)!.cEstAToi
                    : AppLocalizations.of(
                      context,
                    )!.auTourDe2(currentPotatoPlayerName),
                style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.headlineSmall?.copyWith(
                  fontWeight: FontWeight.bold,
                  color: isMyTurn ? Colors.redAccent : Colors.white,
                ),
              ),
              SizedBox(height: 10),
              // Bombe visuelle
              Transform.scale(
                scale: pulseScale,
                child: Container(
                  width: 100,
                  height: 100,
                  decoration: BoxDecoration(
                    shape: BoxShape.circle,
                    color: Colors.black,
                    boxShadow: [
                      BoxShadow(
                        color: timerColor,
                        blurRadius: 20,
                        spreadRadius: 5,
                      ),
                    ],
                  ),
                  child: Center(
                    child: Column(
                      mainAxisAlignment: MainAxisAlignment.center,
                      children: [
                        Icon(
                          Icons.local_fire_department,
                          color: timerColor,
                          size: 40,
                        ),
                        Text(
                          "$secondsLeft",
                          style: TextStyle(
                            fontSize: 24,
                            fontWeight: FontWeight.bold,
                            color: Colors.white,
                          ),
                        ),
                      ],
                    ),
                  ),
                ),
              ),
            ],
          ),
        ),

        SizedBox(height: 30),

        // Carte de la catégorie
        Card(
          elevation: 8,
          shape: RoundedRectangleBorder(
            borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(15),
          ),
          child: Container(
            width: double.infinity,
            padding: const EdgeInsets.all(24.0),
            decoration: BoxDecoration(
              borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(15),
              gradient: LinearGradient(
                colors: [Colors.deepPurple[700]!, Colors.deepPurple[900]!],
              ),
            ),
            child: Column(
              children: [
                Text(
                  AppLocalizations.of(context)!.categorie,
                  style: TextStyle(color: Colors.white70, letterSpacing: 2),
                ),
                SizedBox(height: 10),
                Text(
                  category,
                  style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.headlineMedium?.copyWith(
                    color: Colors.white,
                    fontWeight: FontWeight.bold,
                  ),
                  textAlign: TextAlign.center,
                ),
              ],
            ),
          ),
        ),

        SizedBox(height: 20),

        // Zone de saisie (active seulement si c'est mon tour)
        if (isMyTurn)
          Column(
            children: [
              TextField(
                controller: _answerController,
                autofocus: true,
                decoration: InputDecoration(
                  labelText: AppLocalizations.of(context)!.viteUnMot,
                  filled: true,
                  fillColor: Colors.white,
                  labelStyle: TextStyle(color: Colors.black54),
                  border: OutlineInputBorder(
                    borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(30),
                  ),
                ),
                style: TextStyle(color: Colors.black, fontSize: 18),
                onSubmitted: (_) => _submitHotPotatoAnswer(),
              ),
              SizedBox(height: 15),
              ElevatedButton.icon(
                icon: Icon(Icons.send),
                label: Text(AppLocalizations.of(context)!.validerPasser),
                style: ElevatedButton.styleFrom(
                  backgroundColor: Colors.redAccent,
                  padding: EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 40, vertical: 15),
                  textStyle: TextStyle(
                    fontSize: 18,
                    fontWeight: FontWeight.bold,
                  ),
                ),
                onPressed:
                    _isActionPending ? null : () => _submitHotPotatoAnswer(),
              ),
            ],
          )
        else
          Padding(
            padding: const EdgeInsets.all(16.0),
            child: Text(
              AppLocalizations.of(context)!.prepareTaReponsePendantQue,
              style: TextStyle(
                fontStyle: FontStyle.italic,
                color: Colors.white38,
              ),
            ),
          ),

        Spacer(),

        // Historique des mots
        Container(
          height: 100,
          child: SingleChildScrollView(
            reverse: true,
            child: Wrap(
              spacing: 8.0,
              runSpacing: 4.0,
              alignment: WrapAlignment.center,
              children:
                  usedAnswers
                      .map(
                        (answer) => Chip(
                          label: Text(answer),
                          backgroundColor: Colors.grey[800],
                        ),
                      )
                      .toList(),
            ),
          ),
        ),
      ],
    );
  }

  void _submitHotPotatoAnswer() async {
    if (_isActionPending) return;

    // --- CORRECTION ICI ---
    // Au lieu de : final String playerId = Provider.of<String>(context, listen: false);
    // Utilisez ceci :
    final String playerId = widget.playerId;
    // ----------------------

    final answer = _answerController.text.trim();

    setState(() => _isActionPending = true);
    try {
      await _firebaseService.submitHotPotatoAnswer(
        widget.gameCode,
        playerId,
        answer,
      );
      _answerController.clear();
    } catch (e) {
      ScaffoldMessenger.of(context).showSnackBar(
        SnackBar(
          content: Text(
            GameMessageLocalization.tr(
              context,
              e.toString().replaceAll(
                AppLocalizations.of(context)!.exception,
                '',
              ),
            ),
          ),
        ),
      );
    } finally {
      if (mounted) setState(() => _isActionPending = false);
    }
  }

  Widget _buildHotPotatoExplodedUI(
    BuildContext context,
    Map<String, dynamic> gameData,
    String playerId,
  ) {
    final Map<String, dynamic> players = Map<String, dynamic>.from(
      gameData['players'] ?? {},
    );
    final String? loserId = gameData['roundWinnerId'];
    final String loserName =
        players[loserId]?['name'] ?? AppLocalizations.of(context)!.inconnu;
    final String gameEndReason =
        gameData['gameEndReason'] ??
        AppLocalizations.of(context)!.laPatateAExplose;
    final isHost = gameData['hostId'] == playerId;
    final String gameType = gameData['gameType'] ?? '';
    final bool isCategories = gameType == 'Le Jeu des Catégories';

    if (_isHotPotatoMusicPlaying) {
      _hotPotatoPlayer?.stop();
      _hotPotatoPlayer?.dispose();
      _hotPotatoPlayer = null;
      _isHotPotatoMusicPlaying = false;
    }

    // Build score list for Categories
    List<MapEntry<String, int>> sortedScores = [];
    if (isCategories) {
      players.forEach((id, data) {
        sortedScores.add(
          MapEntry(
            data['name'] ?? AppLocalizations.of(context)!.inconnu,
            data['score'] ?? 0,
          ),
        );
      });
      sortedScores.sort((a, b) => a.value.compareTo(b.value));
    }

    return Column(
      key: ValueKey('exploded_multi'),
      mainAxisAlignment: MainAxisAlignment.center,
      children: [
        Icon(Icons.local_fire_department, size: 100, color: Colors.redAccent),
        SizedBox(height: 20),
        Text(
          AppLocalizations.of(context)!.boom,
          style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.headlineMedium?.copyWith(
            fontSize: 48,
            color: Colors.redAccent,
          ),
        ),
        SizedBox(height: 20),
        Text(
          AppLocalizations.of(context)!.joueurAPerdu(loserName),
          style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.headlineSmall,
        ),
        SizedBox(height: 10),
        Text(
          GameMessageLocalization.tr(context, gameEndReason),
          style: Theme.of(context).textTheme.bodyMedium,
        ),
        if (isCategories) ...[
          SizedBox(height: 20),
          Text(
            AppLocalizations.of(context)!.scoresMoinsMieux,
            style: TextStyle(fontWeight: FontWeight.bold, fontSize: 16),
          ),
          SizedBox(height: 8),
          ...sortedScores.map(
            (e) => Text(
              AppLocalizations.of(
                context,
              )!.pt1(e.key, e.value, e.value > 1 ? 's' : ''),
              style: TextStyle(fontSize: 14),
            ),
          ),
        ],
        SizedBox(height: 40),
        if (isHost)
          ElevatedButton(
            onPressed:
                _isActionPending
                    ? null
                    : () async {
                      setState(() => _isActionPending = true);
                      await _firebaseService
                          .nextHotPotatoRound(widget.gameCode)
                          .whenComplete(() {
                            if (mounted)
                              setState(() => _isActionPending = false);
                          });
                    },
            child:
                _isActionPending
                    ? SizedBox(
                      height: 20,
                      width: 20,
                      child: CircularProgressIndicator(
                        color: Colors.white,
                        strokeWidth: 2,
                      ),
                    )
                    : Text(AppLocalizations.of(context)!.nouvelleManche),
          )
        else
          Text(
            AppLocalizations.of(context)!.enAttenteDeLHote2,
            style: TextStyle(
              fontStyle: FontStyle.italic,
              color: Colors.white70,
            ),
          ),
      ],
    );
  }

  String _getLgTransitionLogs(
    String phase,
    String subPhase,
    List<dynamic> logs,
  ) {
    if (logs.isEmpty) return "";
    if (phase == 'nuit' && subPhase == 'initial') {
      return AppLocalizations.of(context)!.laNuitTombeSurLe;
    } else if (phase == 'jour_discussion' && subPhase.isEmpty) {
      List<String> morningLogs = [];
      for (int i = logs.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
        String log = logs[i].toString();
        morningLogs.insert(0, log);
        if (log.contains(AppLocalizations.of(context)!.leSoleilSeLeve)) break;
      }
      return morningLogs.join("\n\n");
    } else if (phase == 'jour_vote') {
      return AppLocalizations.of(context)!.leMomentEstVenuLe;
    }
    return "";
  }

  // ===========================================================================
  // INTERFACE MODERNE & MINIMALISTE - LOUP-GAROU
  // ===========================================================================

  Widget _buildLoupGarouUI(
    BuildContext context,
    Map<String, dynamic> gameData,
    String playerId,
  ) {
    final String phase = gameData['phase'] ?? 'lobby';
    final Map<String, dynamic> players = Map<String, dynamic>.from(
      gameData['players'] ?? {},
    );
    final List<dynamic> gameLog = List<dynamic>.from(gameData['gameLog'] ?? []);

    if (phase == 'gameOver' || gameData['gameState'] == 'gameOver') {
      String winnerText =
          gameData['gameWinner'] ??
          AppLocalizations.of(context)!.finDeLaPartie1;
      if (winnerText == 'village')
        winnerText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.victoireDesVillageois;
      else if (winnerText == 'loups')
        winnerText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.victoireDesLoupsGarous;
      else if (winnerText == 'amoureux')
        winnerText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.victoireDesAmoureux;
      return UniversalGameEndScreen(
        gameTitle: "Loup-Garou",
        winnerId: gameData['gameWinner'],
        winnerName: winnerText,
        reason:
            gameLog.isNotEmpty
                ? GameMessageLocalization.tr(context, gameLog.last.toString())
                : (gameData['gameEndReason'] ??
                    AppLocalizations.of(context)!.finDuJeu),
        players: players,
        gameData: gameData,
        gameCode: widget.gameCode,
        currentPlayerId: playerId,
        isHost: gameData['hostId'] == playerId,
        onExit: _exitGame,
      );
    }

    final String subPhase = gameData['subPhase'] ?? '';
    final Map<String, dynamic> playerData = Map<String, dynamic>.from(
      gameData['playerData'] ?? {},
    );
    final List<String> playerOrder = List<String>.from(
      gameData['playerOrder'] ?? [],
    );
    final Map<String, dynamic> nightActions = Map<String, dynamic>.from(
      gameData['nightActions'] ?? {},
    );
    final Map<String, dynamic> dayVotes = Map<String, dynamic>.from(
      gameData['dayVotes'] ?? {},
    );
    final String? captainId = gameData['captainId'];
    final List<String> lovers = List<String>.from(gameData['lovers'] ?? []);
    final int nightNumber = gameData['nightNumber'] ?? 0;

    final myData = playerData[playerId] ?? {};
    final myRole = myData['role'] ?? AppLocalizations.of(context)!.inconnu;
    final myStatus = myData['status'] ?? 'vivant';
    final myPrivateInfo = myData['privateInfo'];
    final bool amILoup =
        GameData.roleCamps[myRole] == 'loups' ||
        myData['infectionStatus'] == 'infecte';
    final bool isHost = gameData['hostId'] == playerId;
    final bool isNight = phase == 'nuit';

    // Transition narrative
    if (_lgLastSubPhase != subPhase || _lgLastPhase != phase) {
      WidgetsBinding.instance.addPostFrameCallback((_) {
        if (mounted) {
          setState(() {
            _lgLastSubPhase = subPhase;
            _lgLastPhase = phase;
            _lgLocalSelection.clear();
            _lgActionMode = 'normal';
            _lgTransitionText = _getLgTransitionLogs(phase, subPhase, gameLog);
            if (_lgTransitionText.isNotEmpty) {
              _showLgTransition = true;
              Timer(Duration(seconds: 3), () {
                if (mounted) setState(() => _showLgTransition = false);
              });
            }
          });
        }
      });
    }

    String promptText =
        isNight
            ? AppLocalizations.of(context)!.leVillageSEndort
            : AppLocalizations.of(context)!.leVillageDelibere;
    Widget? centerActionWidget;

    // Décompte des votes
    Map<String, List<String>> votesReceived = {};
    if (phase == 'jour_vote') {
      dayVotes.forEach((voterId, targetId) {
        final voterName =
            playerData[voterId]?['name'] ??
            AppLocalizations.of(context)!.inconnu;
        votesReceived.putIfAbsent(targetId, () => []).add(voterName);
      });

      if (myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.mentaliste &&
          myStatus == 'vivant') {
        String? topTarget;
        int topVotes = 0;
        votesReceived.forEach((target, voters) {
          if (voters.length > topVotes) {
            topVotes = voters.length;
            topTarget = target;
          }
        });
        if (topTarget != null && topVotes > 0) {
          final targetRole = playerData[topTarget]?['role'];
          final isWolf =
              GameData.roleCamps[targetRole] == 'loups' ||
              playerData[topTarget]?['infectionStatus'] == 'infecte';
          if (isWolf) {
            Provider.of<PlayerState>(
              context,
              listen: false,
            ).recordBadgeEvent('lg_mentaliste_detect');
          }
        }
      }
    } else if (phase == 'nuit' && subPhase == 'loups_turn') {
      if (nightActions['votes'] != null) {
        (nightActions['votes'] as Map<String, dynamic>).forEach((
          voterId,
          targetId,
        ) {
          final voterName =
              playerData[voterId]?['name'] ??
              AppLocalizations.of(context)!.loup;
          votesReceived.putIfAbsent(targetId, () => []).add(voterName);
        });
      }
    }

    List<String> contaminatedPlayers = List<String>.from(
      gameData['ratMaladeContaminated'] ?? [],
    );

    // Vérification d'éligibilité pour ciblage
    bool canSelectTarget(String targetId) {
      if (targetId == playerId &&
          !(subPhase == 'garde_turn' || subPhase == 'cupidon_turn'))
        return false;
      if (playerData[targetId]?['status'] != 'vivant') return false;

      if (phase == 'nuit') {
        switch (subPhase) {
          case 'cupidon_turn':
            return myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.cupidon &&
                myStatus == 'vivant' &&
                lovers.isEmpty &&
                !lovers.contains(targetId);
          case 'heritier_turn':
            return myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.heritier &&
                myStatus == 'vivant' &&
                myData['testateurId'] == null;
          case 'garde_turn':
            return myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.garde &&
                myStatus == 'vivant' &&
                nightActions['gardeActed'] != true &&
                myData['lastProtectedId'] != targetId;
          case 'voyante_turn':
            return myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.voyante &&
                myStatus == 'vivant' &&
                nightActions['voyanteActed'] != true;
          case 'rat_malade_turn':
            return myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.ratMalade &&
                myStatus == 'vivant' &&
                !contaminatedPlayers.contains(targetId);
          case 'loups_turn':
            bool targetIsLoup =
                GameData.roleCamps[playerData[targetId]?['role']] == 'loups' ||
                playerData[targetId]?['infectionStatus'] == 'infecte';
            if (amILoup && myStatus == 'vivant') return !targetIsLoup;
            if (myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.petiteFille &&
                myStatus == 'vivant' &&
                !amILoup)
              return true;
            return false;
          case 'loup_blanc_turn':
            return myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.loupBlanc &&
                myStatus == 'vivant' &&
                nightNumber % 2 != 0 &&
                nightActions['loupBlancActed'] != true;
          case 'sorciere_turn':
            return myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.sorciere &&
                myStatus == 'vivant' &&
                _lgActionMode == 'poison' &&
                myData['potions']?['poison'] == true;
          case 'pyromancien_turn':
            return myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.pyromancien &&
                myStatus == 'vivant' &&
                _lgActionMode == 'placer_tonneau';
        }
      } else if (phase == 'jour_discussion') {
        if (subPhase == 'captain_designate' ||
            subPhase == 'chasseur_revenge' ||
            subPhase == 'fossoyeur_reveal' ||
            subPhase == 'dictateur_coup') {
          return gameData['activePlayerId'] == playerId;
        }
      } else if (phase == 'jour_vote') {
        return myStatus == 'vivant' && !dayVotes.containsKey(playerId);
      }
      return false;
    }

    void handleTargetSelection(String targetId) async {
      if (_isActionPending) return;

      if (phase == 'nuit') {
        switch (subPhase) {
          case 'cupidon_turn':
          case 'rat_malade_turn':
            setState(() {
              if (_lgLocalSelection.contains(targetId)) {
                _lgLocalSelection.remove(targetId);
              } else {
                if (_lgLocalSelection.length < 2)
                  _lgLocalSelection.add(targetId);
              }
            });
            break;
          case 'heritier_turn':
            setState(() => _isActionPending = true);
            await _firebaseService.heritierChooseTestateur(
              widget.gameCode,
              playerId,
              targetId,
            );
            setState(() => _isActionPending = false);
            break;
          case 'garde_turn':
            setState(() => _isActionPending = true);
            await _firebaseService.gardeProtect(
              widget.gameCode,
              playerId,
              targetId,
            );
            setState(() => _isActionPending = false);
            break;
          case 'voyante_turn':
            setState(() => _isActionPending = true);
            await _firebaseService.voyanteSee(
              widget.gameCode,
              playerId,
              targetId,
            );
            setState(() => _isActionPending = false);
            break;
          case 'loups_turn':
            setState(() => _isActionPending = true);
            if (amILoup) {
              _firebaseService.updateLoupGarouLiveTarget(
                widget.gameCode,
                playerId,
                targetId,
              );
              await _firebaseService.loupGarouVote(
                widget.gameCode,
                playerId,
                targetId,
              );
            }
            if (myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.petiteFille)
              await _firebaseService.petiteFilleSpy(
                widget.gameCode,
                playerId,
                targetId,
              );
            setState(() => _isActionPending = false);
            break;
          case 'loup_blanc_turn':
            setState(() => _isActionPending = true);
            await _firebaseService.loupBlancDevour(
              widget.gameCode,
              playerId,
              targetId,
            );
            setState(() => _isActionPending = false);
            break;
          case 'sorciere_turn':
            if (_lgActionMode == 'poison') {
              setState(() => _isActionPending = true);
              await _firebaseService.sorciereUsePotion(
                widget.gameCode,
                playerId,
                'poison',
                targetId,
              );
              setState(() {
                _isActionPending = false;
                _lgActionMode = 'normal';
              });
            }
            break;
          case 'pyromancien_turn':
            if (_lgActionMode == 'placer_tonneau') {
              setState(() => _isActionPending = true);
              await _firebaseService.pyromancienAct(
                widget.gameCode,
                playerId,
                'place',
                targetId,
              );
              setState(() {
                _isActionPending = false;
                _lgActionMode = 'normal';
              });
            }
            break;
        }
      } else if (phase == 'jour_discussion') {
        setState(() => _isActionPending = true);
        if (subPhase == 'captain_designate')
          await _firebaseService.captainDesignate(
            widget.gameCode,
            playerId,
            targetId,
          );
        if (subPhase == 'chasseur_revenge') {
          final targetRole = playerData[targetId]?['role'];
          if (GameData.roleCamps[targetRole] == 'loups') {
            Provider.of<PlayerState>(
              context,
              listen: false,
            ).recordBadgeEvent('lg_chasseur_revenge');
          }
          await _firebaseService.chasseurShoot(
            widget.gameCode,
            playerId,
            targetId,
          );
        }
        if (subPhase == 'fossoyeur_reveal')
          await _firebaseService.fossoyeurReveal(
            widget.gameCode,
            playerId,
            targetId,
          );
        if (subPhase == 'dictateur_coup') {
          final targetRole = playerData[targetId]?['role'];
          if (GameData.roleCamps[targetRole] == 'loups') {
            Provider.of<PlayerState>(
              context,
              listen: false,
            ).recordBadgeEvent('lg_dictateur_coup');
          }
          await _firebaseService.dictateurCoup(
            widget.gameCode,
            playerId,
            targetId,
          );
        }
        setState(() => _isActionPending = false);
      } else if (phase == 'jour_vote') {
        setState(() => _isActionPending = true);
        await _firebaseService.submitDayVote(
          widget.gameCode,
          playerId,
          targetId,
        );
        setState(() => _isActionPending = false);
      }
    }

    // Définition des instructions contextuelles et boutons d'action au centre
    if (phase == 'nuit') {
      switch (subPhase) {
        case 'cupidon_turn':
          promptText =
              lovers.isEmpty
                  ? AppLocalizations.of(context)!.designez2Amoureux
                  : AppLocalizations.of(context)!.amoureuxUnis;
          if (myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.cupidon &&
              myStatus == 'vivant' &&
              lovers.isEmpty) {
            centerActionWidget = _buildActionButton(
              label: GameContentLocalization.format(
                context,
                AppLocalizations.of(context)!.validerLeCouple2,
                [_lgLocalSelection.length.toString()],
              ),
              icon: Icons.favorite,
              color: Colors.pinkAccent,
              onPressed:
                  _lgLocalSelection.length == 2
                      ? () async {
                        setState(() => _isActionPending = true);
                        for (String tgt in _lgLocalSelection) {
                          await _firebaseService.selectCupidonLover(
                            widget.gameCode,
                            playerId,
                            tgt,
                          );
                        }
                        setState(() {
                          _isActionPending = false;
                          _lgLocalSelection.clear();
                        });
                      }
                      : null,
            );
          }
          break;
        case 'heritier_turn':
          promptText =
              AppLocalizations.of(context)!.lHeritierChoisitSonTestament;
          if (myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.heritier &&
              myStatus == 'vivant' &&
              myData['testateurId'] == null) {
            promptText =
                AppLocalizations.of(context)!.selectionnezVotreTestateur;
          }
          break;
        case 'garde_turn':
          promptText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.leGardeProtegeUnVillageois;
          if (myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.garde &&
              myStatus == 'vivant' &&
              nightActions['gardeActed'] != true) {
            promptText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.selectionnezQuiProteger;
          }
          break;
        case 'voyante_turn':
          promptText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.laVoyanteConsulteLesAstres;
          if (myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.voyante &&
              myStatus == 'vivant' &&
              nightActions['voyanteActed'] != true) {
            promptText =
                AppLocalizations.of(context)!.touchezUnJoueurPourSonder;
          }
          break;
        case 'rat_malade_turn':
          promptText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.leRatMaladeRode;
          if (myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.ratMalade &&
              myStatus == 'vivant') {
            promptText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.contaminezJusquA2Joueurs;
            centerActionWidget = _buildActionButton(
              label: GameContentLocalization.format(
                context,
                AppLocalizations.of(context)!.contaminer,
                [_lgLocalSelection.length.toString()],
              ),
              icon: Icons.sick,
              color: Colors.lightGreenAccent,
              onPressed:
                  _lgLocalSelection.isNotEmpty
                      ? () async {
                        setState(() => _isActionPending = true);
                        await _firebaseService.ratMaladeContaminate(
                          widget.gameCode,
                          playerId,
                          _lgLocalSelection,
                        );
                        setState(() {
                          _isActionPending = false;
                          _lgLocalSelection.clear();
                        });
                      }
                      : null,
            );
          }
          break;
        case 'loups_turn':
          promptText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.lesLoupsChassentEnMeute;
          if (amILoup && myStatus == 'vivant')
            promptText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.votezPourDevorerUneProie;
          if (myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.petiteFille &&
              myStatus == 'vivant' &&
              !amILoup)
            promptText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.espionnezUnJoueur;
          break;
        case 'loup_noir_action':
          promptText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.leLoupNoirDecideDu;
          String? loupNoirId =
              playerData.entries
                  .firstWhere(
                    (e) =>
                        e.value['role'] ==
                            AppLocalizations.of(context)!.loupNoir &&
                        e.value['status'] == 'vivant',
                    orElse: () => MapEntry('', {}),
                  )
                  .key;
          if (loupNoirId == playerId &&
              myStatus == 'vivant' &&
              !(myData['infectionUsed'] ?? true) &&
              nightActions['loupTarget'] != null) {
            String targetName =
                playerData[nightActions['loupTarget']]?['name'] ??
                AppLocalizations.of(context)!.laVictime;
            promptText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.infecter1(targetName);
            centerActionWidget = Row(
              mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
              children: [
                _buildActionButton(
                  label: AppLocalizations.of(context)!.infecter,
                  icon: Icons.auto_fix_high,
                  color: Colors.purpleAccent,
                  onPressed: () {
                    Provider.of<PlayerState>(
                      context,
                      listen: false,
                    ).recordBadgeEvent('lg_loup_noir_infect');
                    _firebaseService.loupNoirInfect(
                      widget.gameCode,
                      playerId,
                      true,
                    );
                  },
                ),
                const SizedBox(width: 8),
                _buildActionButton(
                  label: AppLocalizations.of(context)!.devorer,
                  icon: Icons.close,
                  color: Colors.redAccent,
                  onPressed:
                      () => _firebaseService.loupNoirInfect(
                        widget.gameCode,
                        playerId,
                        false,
                      ),
                ),
              ],
            );
          }
          break;
        case 'loup_blanc_turn':
          promptText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.leLoupBlancFrappeEn;
          if (myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.loupBlanc &&
              myStatus == 'vivant' &&
              nightNumber % 2 != 0 &&
              nightActions['loupBlancActed'] != true) {
            promptText =
                AppLocalizations.of(context)!.choisissezUneVictimeADevorer;
          }
          break;
        case 'sorciere_turn':
          promptText =
              AppLocalizations.of(context)!.laSorcierePrepareSesPotions;
          if (myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.sorciere &&
              myStatus == 'vivant' &&
              nightActions['sorciereActed'] != true) {
            final victimeId = nightActions['loupTarget'];
            final victimeName =
                (victimeId != null && playerData[victimeId] != null)
                    ? playerData[victimeId]['name']
                    : AppLocalizations.of(
                      context,
                    )!.aucuneVictimeCetteNuitProtegee;
            promptText = AppLocalizations.of(
              context,
            )!.cibleDesLoups(victimeName);
            if (_lgActionMode == 'poison')
              promptText =
                  AppLocalizations.of(context)!.touchezLeJoueurAEliminer;

            centerActionWidget = Wrap(
              spacing: 6,
              runSpacing: 6,
              alignment: WrapAlignment.center,
              children: [
                if (myData['potions']?['guerison'] == true && victimeId != null)
                  _buildActionButton(
                    label: AppLocalizations.of(context)!.sauver,
                    icon: Icons.health_and_safety,
                    color: Colors.greenAccent,
                    onPressed:
                        () => _firebaseService.sorciereUsePotion(
                          widget.gameCode,
                          playerId,
                          'guerison',
                          victimeId,
                        ),
                  ),
                if (myData['potions']?['poison'] == true)
                  _buildActionButton(
                    label:
                        _lgActionMode == 'poison'
                            ? AppLocalizations.of(context)!.annuler
                            : AppLocalizations.of(context)!.empoisonner,
                    icon: Icons.science,
                    color:
                        _lgActionMode == 'poison'
                            ? Colors.amberAccent
                            : Colors.purpleAccent,
                    onPressed:
                        () => setState(
                          () =>
                              _lgActionMode =
                                  _lgActionMode == 'poison'
                                      ? 'normal'
                                      : 'poison',
                        ),
                  ),
                _buildActionButton(
                  label: AppLocalizations.of(context)!.neRienFaire,
                  icon: Icons.nightlight_round,
                  color: Colors.white60,
                  onPressed:
                      () => _firebaseService.sorciereUsePotion(
                        widget.gameCode,
                        playerId,
                        'rien',
                        null,
                      ),
                ),
              ],
            );
          }
          break;
        case 'pyromancien_turn':
          promptText =
              AppLocalizations.of(context)!.lePyromancienPrepareSesExplosifs;
          if (myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.pyromancien &&
              myStatus == 'vivant') {
            centerActionWidget = Row(
              mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
              children: [
                _buildActionButton(
                  label:
                      _lgActionMode == 'placer_tonneau'
                          ? AppLocalizations.of(context)!.annuler
                          : AppLocalizations.of(context)!.poserTonneau,
                  icon: Icons.local_gas_station,
                  color: Colors.orangeAccent,
                  onPressed:
                      () => setState(
                        () =>
                            _lgActionMode =
                                _lgActionMode == 'placer_tonneau'
                                    ? 'normal'
                                    : 'placer_tonneau',
                      ),
                ),
                SizedBox(width: 8),
                _buildActionButton(
                  label: AppLocalizations.of(context)!.faireExploser,
                  icon: Icons.local_fire_department,
                  color: Colors.redAccent,
                  onPressed:
                      () => _firebaseService.pyromancienAct(
                        widget.gameCode,
                        playerId,
                        'detonate',
                        null,
                      ),
                ),
              ],
            );
          }
          break;
      }
    } else if (phase == 'jour_discussion') {
      promptText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.debatsDuVillage;
      if (subPhase == 'captain_designate') {
        promptText =
            AppLocalizations.of(context)!.leCapitaineDesigneSonSuccesseur;
      } else if (subPhase == 'chasseur_revenge') {
        promptText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.dernierTirDuChasseur;
      } else if (subPhase == 'fossoyeur_reveal') {
        promptText =
            AppLocalizations.of(context)!.leFossoyeurReveleUneSepulture;
      } else if (subPhase == 'dictateur_coup') {
        promptText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.coupDEtatDuDictateur;
      } else {
        if (myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.dictateur &&
            myStatus == 'vivant' &&
            !(myData['powerUsed'] ?? false) &&
            !(gameData['dictatorUsed'] ?? false)) {
          centerActionWidget = _buildActionButton(
            label: AppLocalizations.of(context)!.coupDEtat,
            icon: Icons.gavel,
            color: Colors.deepPurpleAccent,
            onPressed:
                () => _firebaseService.triggerDictateurCoup(
                  widget.gameCode,
                  playerId,
                ),
          );
        }
        if (isHost) {
          centerActionWidget = _buildActionButton(
            label: AppLocalizations.of(context)!.ouvrirLesVotes,
            icon: Icons.how_to_vote,
            color: Colors.amberAccent,
            onPressed:
                () => _firebaseService.startDayVotePhase(widget.gameCode),
          );
        }
      }
    } else if (phase == 'jour_vote') {
      promptText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.voteDuTribunalPopulaire;
      if (myStatus == 'vivant' && !dayVotes.containsKey(playerId)) {
        promptText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.touchezUnSuspectPourVoter;
      } else if (isHost) {
        centerActionWidget = _buildActionButton(
          label: AppLocalizations.of(context)!.cloturerLeVote,
          icon: Icons.done_all,
          color: Colors.amberAccent,
          onPressed: () => _firebaseService.processDayVote(widget.gameCode),
        );
      }
    } else if (phase == 'gameOver') {
      promptText = AppLocalizations.of(context)!.partieTerminee1;
      centerActionWidget = Column(
        mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
        children: [
          Text(
            gameLog.isNotEmpty
                ? GameMessageLocalization.tr(context, gameLog.last.toString())
                : AppLocalizations.of(context)!.finDuJeu,
            style: TextStyle(
              color: Colors.white,
              fontSize: 13,
              fontWeight: FontWeight.w600,
            ),
            textAlign: TextAlign.center,
          ),
          SizedBox(height: 8),
          Row(
            mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
            children: [
              _buildActionButton(
                label: AppLocalizations.of(context)!.quitter,
                icon: Icons.exit_to_app,
                color: Colors.redAccent,
                onPressed: () => _exitGame(),
              ),
              if (isHost) ...[
                SizedBox(width: 8),
                _buildActionButton(
                  label: AppLocalizations.of(context)!.rejouer,
                  icon: Icons.replay,
                  color: Colors.greenAccent,
                  onPressed:
                      () =>
                          _firebaseService.resetLoupGarouGame(widget.gameCode),
                ),
              ],
            ],
          ),
        ],
      );
    }

    final bool canSeeLovers =
        lovers.contains(playerId) ||
        myRole == AppLocalizations.of(context)!.cupidon;

    return Container(
      decoration: BoxDecoration(
        gradient: RadialGradient(
          center: Alignment.center,
          radius: 1.1,
          colors:
              isNight
                  ? [Color(0xFF0F172A), Color(0xFF020617)]
                  : [Color(0xFF1E293B), Color(0xFF0F172A)],
        ),
      ),
      child: Stack(
        children: [
          // 1. CERCLE DES JOUEURS (ARENA)
          Positioned.fill(
            child: LayoutBuilder(
              builder: (context, constraints) {
                final double width = constraints.maxWidth;
                final double height = constraints.maxHeight;
                final double centerX = width / 2;
                final double centerY = height * 0.44;
                final double radius = min(width, height) * 0.36;

                return Stack(
                  alignment: Alignment.center,
                  children: [
                    // Décoration centrale subtile
                    Positioned(
                      left: centerX - (radius * 0.9),
                      top: centerY - (radius * 0.9),
                      width: radius * 1.8,
                      height: radius * 1.8,
                      child: Container(
                        decoration: BoxDecoration(
                          shape: BoxShape.circle,
                          border: Border.all(
                            color:
                                isNight
                                    ? Colors.cyanAccent.withOpacity(0.06)
                                    : Colors.amberAccent.withOpacity(0.06),
                            width: 1.5,
                          ),
                        ),
                      ),
                    ),

                    // Actions centrales (ne chevauchent plus)
                    if (centerActionWidget != null)
                      Positioned(
                        left: 40,
                        right: 40,
                        top: centerY - 32,
                        child: Center(child: centerActionWidget),
                      ),

                    // Avatars des joueurs disposés en cercle
                    ...playerOrder.asMap().entries.map((entry) {
                      final int index = entry.key;
                      final String pId = entry.value;
                      final double angle =
                          (2 * pi * index) / max(1, playerOrder.length) -
                          (pi / 2);
                      final pData = playerData[pId] ?? {};
                      final x = radius * cos(angle);
                      final y = radius * sin(angle);

                      const double avatarSize = 54.0;
                      return Positioned(
                        left: centerX + x - (avatarSize / 2),
                        top: centerY + y - (avatarSize / 2),
                        child: StreamBuilder<DatabaseEvent>(
                          stream: _firebaseService.getLoupGarouLiveTargetStream(
                            widget.gameCode,
                          ),
                          builder: (context, liveSnap) {
                            List<String> targetingWolves = [];
                            if (subPhase == 'loups_turn' &&
                                amILoup &&
                                liveSnap.hasData &&
                                liveSnap.data!.snapshot.value != null) {
                              try {
                                final raw = Map<String, dynamic>.from(
                                  liveSnap.data!.snapshot.value as Map,
                                );
                                raw.forEach((wId, wData) {
                                  if (wData is Map &&
                                      wData['targetId'] == pId) {
                                    final wName =
                                        playerData[wId]?['name'] ??
                                        AppLocalizations.of(context)!.loup;
                                    targetingWolves.add(wName);
                                  }
                                });
                              } catch (_) {}
                            }

                            final bool isWolfTargeted =
                                targetingWolves.isNotEmpty;

                            return Stack(
                              clipBehavior: Clip.none,
                              children: [
                                _buildPlayerAvatar(
                                  pData,
                                  pId,
                                  pId == playerId,
                                  votesReceived[pId],
                                  captainId,
                                  lovers,
                                  amILoup,
                                  nightNumber,
                                  currentRoundState: phase,
                                  contaminatedPlayers: contaminatedPlayers,
                                  canSeeLovers: canSeeLovers,
                                  isSelectable: canSelectTarget(pId),
                                  isSelected: _lgLocalSelection.contains(pId),
                                  onTap: () => handleTargetSelection(pId),
                                ),
                                if (isWolfTargeted)
                                  Positioned(
                                    top: -8,
                                    right: -8,
                                    child: Container(
                                      padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(
                                        horizontal: 6,
                                        vertical: 2,
                                      ),
                                      decoration: BoxDecoration(
                                        color: Colors.red[900],
                                        borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(10),
                                        border: Border.all(
                                          color: Colors.redAccent,
                                          width: 1.5,
                                        ),
                                        boxShadow: [
                                          BoxShadow(
                                            color: Colors.redAccent.withOpacity(
                                              0.6,
                                            ),
                                            blurRadius: 8,
                                          ),
                                        ],
                                      ),
                                      child: Row(
                                        mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
                                        children: [
                                          Text(
                                            "🐺",
                                            style: TextStyle(fontSize: 10),
                                          ),
                                          SizedBox(width: 2),
                                          Text(
                                            targetingWolves.first,
                                            style: TextStyle(
                                              color: Colors.white,
                                              fontSize: 9,
                                              fontWeight: FontWeight.bold,
                                            ),
                                          ),
                                        ],
                                      ),
                                    ),
                                  ),
                              ],
                            );
                          },
                        ),
                      );
                    }).toList(),
                  ],
                );
              },
            ),
          ),

          // 2. HUD MINIMALISTE SUPÉRIEUR
          Positioned(
            top: 8,
            left: 12,
            right: 12,
            child: Container(
              padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 14, vertical: 8),
              decoration: BoxDecoration(
                color: Color(0xFF0F172A).withOpacity(0.8),
                borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(16),
                border: Border.all(color: Colors.white.withOpacity(0.08)),
                boxShadow: [
                  BoxShadow(
                    color: Colors.black.withOpacity(0.3),
                    blurRadius: 10,
                    offset: Offset(0, 4),
                  ),
                ],
              ),
              child: Row(
                children: [
                  // Icône Phase
                  Container(
                    padding: const EdgeInsets.all(6),
                    decoration: BoxDecoration(
                      color:
                          isNight
                              ? Colors.indigo.withOpacity(0.3)
                              : Colors.amber.withOpacity(0.2),
                      shape: BoxShape.circle,
                    ),
                    child: Icon(
                      isNight
                          ? Icons.nights_stay_rounded
                          : Icons.wb_sunny_rounded,
                      size: 16,
                      color: isNight ? Colors.cyanAccent : Colors.amberAccent,
                    ),
                  ),
                  SizedBox(width: 10),

                  // Texte de consigne & rôle
                  Expanded(
                    child: Column(
                      crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
                      mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
                      children: [
                        Text(
                          promptText,
                          style: TextStyle(
                            color: Colors.white,
                            fontSize: 13,
                            fontWeight: FontWeight.bold,
                          ),
                          maxLines: 1,
                          overflow: TextOverflow.ellipsis,
                        ),
                        if (myPrivateInfo != null &&
                            myPrivateInfo.toString().trim().isNotEmpty)
                          Text(
                            myPrivateInfo.toString(),
                            style: TextStyle(
                              color: Colors.lightBlueAccent,
                              fontSize: 10,
                            ),
                            maxLines: 1,
                            overflow: TextOverflow.ellipsis,
                          ),
                      ],
                    ),
                  ),

                  // Badge Rôle discret
                  Container(
                    padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(
                      horizontal: 10,
                      vertical: 4,
                    ),
                    decoration: BoxDecoration(
                      color:
                          amILoup
                              ? Colors.redAccent.withOpacity(0.2)
                              : Colors.deepPurpleAccent.withOpacity(0.2),
                      borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(12),
                      border: Border.all(
                        color:
                            amILoup
                                ? Colors.redAccent.withOpacity(0.5)
                                : Colors.deepPurpleAccent.withOpacity(0.5),
                      ),
                    ),
                    child: Text(
                      myRole,
                      style: TextStyle(
                        color: amILoup ? Color(0xFFFCA5A5) : Color(0xFFDDD6FE),
                        fontWeight: FontWeight.bold,
                        fontSize: 11,
                      ),
                    ),
                  ),
                ],
              ),
            ),
          ),

          // 3. TCHAT LIVE ÉLÉGANT & INTÉGRÉ AU BAS
          Positioned(
            bottom: 6,
            left: 10,
            right: 10,
            height: MediaQuery.of(context).size.height * 0.28,
            child: _buildChatInterface(gameData, playerId, isLiveStyle: true),
          ),

          // 4. TRANSITION NARRATIVE ÉPURÉE
          if (_showLgTransition)
            Positioned.fill(
              child: AnimatedOpacity(
                opacity: _showLgTransition ? 1.0 : 0.0,
                duration: Duration(milliseconds: 400),
                child: Container(
                  color: Colors.black.withOpacity(0.85),
                  child: Center(
                    child: Padding(
                      padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 32.0),
                      child: Text(
                        _lgTransitionText,
                        textAlign: TextAlign.center,
                        style: TextStyle(
                          fontSize: 20,
                          color:
                              isNight
                                  ? Colors.cyanAccent.shade100
                                  : Colors.amberAccent.shade100,
                          fontWeight: FontWeight.bold,
                          height: 1.4,
                          letterSpacing: 0.5,
                        ),
                      ),
                    ),
                  ),
                ),
              ),
            ),
        ],
      ),
    );
  }

  // --- BOUTON D'ACTION GLASSMORPHIC ---
  Widget _buildActionButton({
    required String label,
    required IconData icon,
    required Color color,
    required VoidCallback? onPressed,
  }) {
    return ElevatedButton.icon(
      icon: Icon(icon, size: 14, color: Colors.white),
      label: Text(
        label,
        style: TextStyle(fontSize: 11, fontWeight: FontWeight.bold),
      ),
      style: ElevatedButton.styleFrom(
        backgroundColor: color.withOpacity(0.85),
        foregroundColor: Colors.white,
        elevation: 4,
        padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 12, vertical: 8),
        shape: RoundedRectangleBorder(borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(16)),
      ),
      onPressed: onPressed,
    );
  }

  // --- AVATAR ÉPURÉ & MODERNE ---
  Widget _buildPlayerAvatar(
    Map<String, dynamic> pData,
    String pId,
    bool isMe,
    List<String>? voters,
    String? captainId,
    List<String> lovers,
    bool amICurrentPlayerLoup,
    int nightNumber, {
    required String currentRoundState,
    required List<String> contaminatedPlayers,
    bool canSeeLovers = true,
    bool isSelectable = false,
    bool isSelected = false,
    VoidCallback? onTap,
  }) {
    final bool isDead = pData['status'] == 'mort';
    final String name = pData['name'] ?? '?';
    final bool isCaptain = (pId == captainId);
    final bool isLover = lovers.contains(pId) && canSeeLovers;
    final bool isInfected = pData['infectionStatus'] == 'infecte';
    final bool isContaminated =
        contaminatedPlayers.contains(pId) &&
        contaminatedPlayers.contains(widget.playerId);
    final bool isLoupRole = GameData.roleCamps[pData['role']] == 'loups';
    final bool showWolfGlow =
        currentRoundState == 'nuit' &&
        (amICurrentPlayerLoup || isInfected) &&
        (isLoupRole || isInfected);

    Color borderColor = Colors.white.withOpacity(0.15);
    Color bgColor = Color(0xFF1E293B);

    if (isDead) {
      bgColor = Colors.black.withOpacity(0.6);
      borderColor = Colors.white10;
    } else if (isSelected) {
      borderColor = Colors.greenAccent;
    } else if (isSelectable) {
      borderColor = Colors.cyanAccent;
    } else if (showWolfGlow) {
      borderColor = Colors.redAccent.withOpacity(0.8);
      bgColor = Color(0xFF450A0A);
    } else if (isMe) {
      borderColor = Colors.deepPurpleAccent.withOpacity(0.8);
    }

    return GestureDetector(
      onTap: isSelectable ? onTap : null,
      child: Column(
        mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
        children: [
          Stack(
